## CI/CD Pipeline

### Pipeline Stages

| Stage | Tools | Duration | Pass Rate |
|-------|-------|----------|-----------|
| Build | GitHub Actions | 3 min | 99% |
| Unit Tests | Jest, pytest | 5 min | 97% |
| Integration Tests | Cypress, Postman | 6 min | 95% |
| Security Scan | Snyk, SonarQube | 2 min | 99% |
| Deploy to Staging | ArgoCD | 2 min | 99% |
| E2E Tests | Playwright | 8 min | 94% |
| Deploy to Production | ArgoCD | 2 min | 99% |
| **Total** | — | **~28 min** | — |

### Pipeline Configuration

| Component | Technology |
|-----------|------------|
| Source Control | GitHub |
| CI | GitHub Actions |
| CD | ArgoCD |
