## Infrastructure as Code

### IaC Tools

| Tool | Purpose | Coverage |
|------|---------|----------|
| Terraform | AWS infrastructure | 95% |
| Helm | Kubernetes manifests | 100% |
| Ansible | Configuration management | 80% |
| Pulumi | Complex logic | 10% |

### Repository Structure

```
infrastructure/
├── terraform/
│   ├── modules/
│   ├── environments/
│   │   ├── prod/
│   │   ├── staging/
│   │   └── dev/
├── kubernetes/
│   ├── base/
│   ├── overlays/
│   └── charts/
└── ansible/
    └── playbooks/
```

### IaC Practices

| Practice | Implementation |
|----------|----------------|
| Version Control | All code in GitHub |
| Code Review | Required for all changes |
| Automated Testing | terraform validate, helm lint |
| Drift Detection | Weekly Terraform plan |
| Documentation | README per module |

