## Security in DevOps

### Security Scanning

| Stage | Tool | Purpose |
|-------|------|---------|
| Pre-commit | GitLeaks | Secret detection |
| Build | Snyk | Dependency vulnerabilities |
| Build | SonarQube | SAST |
| Build | Trivy | Container scanning |
| Runtime | Falco | Runtime security |
| Periodic | Qualys | Infrastructure scanning |

### Security Gates

| Gate | Criteria | Enforcement |
|------|----------|-------------|
| Secret Detection | 0 secrets | Blocking |
| Critical Vulnerabilities | 0 critical | Blocking |
| High Vulnerabilities | < 5 new | Warning |
| Code Coverage | > 80% | Warning |
| SAST Findings | 0 critical/high | Blocking |

### Compliance Automation

| Requirement | Automation |
|-------------|------------|
| Access Logs | Automated collection |
| Change Tracking | Git-based audit |
| Vulnerability Reports | Automated generation |
| Compliance Checks | Scheduled scanning |

